            "title": "How do I release more trimmer line?",
            "text": "<p>This trimmer features a bump line feed. In order to release more trimming line, firmly tap the bump cap on the trimmer head while the trimmer is running.</p><p>This will automatically advance a new length of trimmer line and trim the line to the correct length. A firm but gentle motion should be used when tapping the bump cap on the lawn.</p><p>This advancing process may be repeated as often as<br/>necessary. Never try to advance the line on a hard surface.</p>",
